Third-party code in the source repository only
----------------------------------------------

The following are part of this repository but are not compiled into either
binary.

third_party/qrl-keystore/ holds a pristine copy of the QRL keystore v1
implementation (go-qrl-wallet-encryptor-keystore, from
https://github.com/theQRL/qrysm), Copyright (c) 2023 The Quantum Resistant
Ledger, licensed under the MIT License. See its LICENSE file and
LICENSES/MIT.txt.

The QRL keystore v1 implementation includes code derived from
go-eth2-wallet-encryptor-keystorev4
(https://github.com/wealdtech/go-eth2-wallet-encryptor-keystorev4),
Copyright © 2019 - 2023 Weald Technology Trading, licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0. See LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt.

The hardened keystore that the signer will compile, under
internal/keys/keystore/qrlv1/, is a modified copy of that code; once it is
linked, the two paragraphs above apply to the binaries as well.

internal/consensus/types/fastssz_mirror_htr_test.go is output of the sszgen
generator of fastssz (https://github.com/ferranbt/fastssz), whose templates
are Copyright (c) 2020 Ferran Borreguero, licensed under the MIT License. It
is a test file.
